7857:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPOLARITY_INVERTED: active low or falling edge active.
7858:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPOLARITY_NONINVERTED: active high or rising edge active.
